Conflicts: libegl-mesa0, libgl1-mesa-dri, libglx-mesa0, libgbm1, mesa-opencl-icd, mesa-va-drivers, mesa-vdpau-drivers, mesa-vulkan-drivers, libosmesa6
Replaces: libegl-mesa0, libgl1-mesa-dri, libglx-mesa0, libgbm1, mesa-opencl-icd, mesa-va-drivers, mesa-vdpau-drivers, mesa-vulkan-drivers, libosmesa6
Description: PocketForge source-built Mesa vendor for the open GPU image
 This package owns the exact gpu-um-tsp install tree, its GLVND EGL and GLX
 vendor routes, GBM and Zink Gallium implementation, and PowerVR Vulkan ICD.
 It satisfies Debian's Mesa driver package relationships without installing a
 second vendor stack.
